<title>USA: Clean Harbors CFO Donald Leef resigns.</title>
<headline>Clean Harbors CFO Donald Leef resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BRAINTREE, Mass. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clean Harbors Inc said on Friday that chief financial officer, Donald Leef, has resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>David Eckert, who was named president and chief operating officer on May 29, will serve as acting chief financial officer until a successor is appointed, the company said.</p>
<p>Eckert joined Clean Harbors in March 1996 as executive vice president and chief operating officer, Clean Harbors said.</p>
